    {
      "text": "不同氏族护甲、武器与失落神器可拼出专属战斗流派",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Choose the precision-crafted armor of Yuheng Clan artisans, the ocean-forged blades of Shark Tribe warriors, or wield the lost artifacts of ancient mages. Customize a one-of-a-kind combat style to overcome diverse battlefield challenges.",
